A||N||15||Monkeyman||I can't believe...||||4||
Z||000000||Monkeyman||07-10-2001||05:44 PM||||...a fuel pump can cost so much and solve so many problems.  Ever since I bought 4Play, I've had troubles with cold starting, terrible low rpm hesitation, etc.  It got so bad that I couldn't even run my A/C without killing the motor.  I tried Berrymans B12.  That seemed to help a little, but the problem came back with a vengeance.  I finally took her to the shop (most of you know how mechanically challenged I am).  I got her back today with a new fuel pump.  Wow!  What a difference.  No low rpm hesitation, and no cold start problems whatsoever.  Now she runs like a champ.  Of course, I'm about $320 poorer, but it was worth it.  What's the point in having a Fiero if it just sits outside looking sad 'cause it can't get up and play?  Now on to the interior!<BR><P>------------------<BR>'Consciousness:  That annoying time between naps.'<P>MM||||reg||4
