Z||000003||Voytek||07-10-2001||06:22 PM||||Hey MM<BR>That's awesome.  My Fiero has about 125,000 miles on it and I've had it for the last 40,000.  Anyways, as far as I know, the pump has never been replaced.  In the last while (3 months maybe) the car has more cold start problems and the pump sometimes seems to make different sounds.  It even seems to run on for quite a while after shutting off the ignition.  I'm thinking maybe it's time for a new one.  What brand did the shop put in for you?  Does the new one make any difference in power?<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||1
